.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B Snmp Configuration
See configuration file example in \fB/etc/snmp/snmpd.conf.rpimonitor\fP
and activate pass_persist extension
.TP
Extract MIB from \fBRPi\-Monitor\fP
\fBrpimonitord \-m > ~/mib.txt\fP
.TP
.B Get data from SNMP
\fBsnmpwalk \-v 2c \-m ~/mib.txt \-c public 127.0.0.1 1.3.6.1.4.1.54321.42\fP
